cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its documentation, please cite it as below."
title: "gen9-gpu-blas"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  BLAS levels 1-3 (FP16, FP32, FP64) for the Intel UHD Graphics 620 (Gen9.5) integrated GPU, with hand-written
  assembly GEMM loops and kcl, a minimal OpenCL subset that submits work directly to the Linux i915 driver.
  Includes a performance model and measurement results. Developed with AI assistance (Claude, Anthropic).
authors:
  - family-names: Przybyszewski
    given-names: Karol
license: MIT
keywords:
  - BLAS
  - GEMM
  - Intel Gen9
  - UHD Graphics 620
  - i915
  - OpenCL
  - GPU assembly
